Allwinner T113 Video Engine and Cedrus JPEG encoder for Linux 6.18.64

Ported from sunxi-mainline/t113-linux-6.18.39, commits cea6d9078abf,
de315dd10e8c, 94373e649809, 1d5b78cc58f5 and e61479adcc4d.
Preserve 6.18.64 probe cleanup and prevent simultaneous encoder and
decoder access to the shared VE registers. The KVMPanel DT enables VE.

